WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.665
A breakdown, a medical bill, a month without income.

2
00:00:03.794 --> 00:00:04.826
Are you ready?

3
00:00:05.926 --> 00:00:10.314
An emergency fund is the first layer of protection, before any other goal,

4
00:00:10.338 --> 00:00:13.785
so that something unexpected does not turn into debt.

5
00:00:14.885 --> 00:00:18.146
The usual goal is three to six months of basic costs,

6
00:00:18.275 --> 00:00:20.654
and more if your income is irregular.

7
00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:27.837
Count housing, food, bills, children, premiums and repayments,

8
00:00:27.931 --> 00:00:31.935
and keep the fund in a separate account you can reach at once.

9
00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:35.113
If today you cover less than three months,

10
00:00:35.113 --> 00:00:37.365
make three months your first goal.

11
00:00:38.465 --> 00:00:41.819
See how much you need with the free tool on avrastro.com.
